Gremlins 2: The New Batch is a 1990 American comedy horror
film and the sequel to Gremlins (1984).

13
00:55:07,200 --> 00:55:13,200
It was directed by Joe Dante, written by Charles S.

14
00:59:21,599 --> 00:59:27,599
Haas and features creature designs by Rick Baker.

15
01:03:36,000 --> 01:03:42,000
Zach Galligan and Phoebe Cates reprise their roles from the first film, with John
Glover, Robert Prosky, Robert Picardo and Christopher Lee joining the cast.

16
01:07:50,400 --> 01:07:56,400
It continues the story of Billy Peltzer and the mogwai Gizmo, who spawns more of his kind when wet that
eventually become imp-like monsters and proceed to wreak havoc within a skyscraper in New York City.

17
01:12:04,800 --> 01:12:10,800
The film heavily parodies its predecessor, with more
cartoonish elements and less horror.

18
01:16:19,199 --> 01:16:25,199
There are a number of parodies of other forms of popular culture, including the Rambo
franchise, The Wizard of Oz, Marathon Man and The Phantom of the Opera.

19
01:20:33,600 --> 01:20:39,600
It was theatrically released on June 15, 1990, and
received generally positive reviews.

20
01:24:48,000 --> 01:24:54,000
It grossed $42 million on a budget of $30–50 million.

21
01:29:02,400 --> 01:29:08,400
Since its release, it has developed a cult following.

22
